		Bestiary: {
			EbonstoneGolem: A hulking ebonstone construct that hurls cursed rock through the caverns.
			CrimstoneGolem: A blood-soaked stone golem. Its thrown rocks leave lingering ichor.
			PearlstoneGolem: A pearlescent golem whose strikes leave foes disoriented.
			GoblinMechanic: A goblin siege engineer. It deploys ballistae to pin down townsfolk and adventurers.
			GoblinShaman: A support caster that strips curses from fellow goblins or mends their wounds.
			BattleBallista: A goblin-built ballista. It fires armor-piercing bolts at players and townsfolk.
			BloodZombieArmed: A blood zombie still clutching a severed arm as a weapon.
			SporeZombieArmed: A spore-infected zombie swinging a mushroom-crusted arm.
			GoldCritter: A rare golden variant of a familiar critter. Collectors pay a fortune for them.
		}
